caption: Separate Effects
technology-rule: separate-effects

Suppose four chems grant:

ST +1

DX +1

IQ +1

HT +1

Taking all four produces:

Four buff packages.

Four addiction rolls.

Four points of Chem Capacity.

Four independent Clearance Intervals.

Four separate production costs.

Putting all four chemicals into one syringe changes none of this.
